# Shared secrets for the beta deployment. Copy to .env and fill in.
# .env is gitignored; never commit a real token.
#
# BETA_TOKENS is comma-separated so tokens can be rotated without cutting
# every tester off at once: add the new one, ship a build carrying it, then
# drop the old one. Generate with: python3 -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
BETA_TOKENS=
